/target

# Local-only docs: keep only README files under version control.
*.md
!**/README.md

# Claude Code local settings + its editor/session artifacts. settings.local.json holds the
# LiteLLM key, and the tooling leaves timestamped `.bak-*` copies of it beside the original —
# ignore the whole family, not just the one name, so a stray `git add -A` can never stage a key.
.claude/settings.local.json*
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
